---
// 聊天室入口 — 页面唯一的强调色块，重点 CTA
---

<section class="px-5 py-10 sm:px-6 sm:py-14">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
    <a
      href="https://chat.loopv.net"
      class="group block rounded-2xl bg-accent p-8 text-white transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-accent-hover sm:p-12"
    >
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-10 sm:flex-row sm:items-end sm:justify-between">
        <div class="max-w-prose">
          <p class="font-mono text-[13px] text-white/55">02 — 聊天室</p>
          <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">进来聊聊</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-white/70">
            chat.loopv.net 是我搭的一个匿名聊天室，注册个账号就能说话。文字、图片、语音都有，没什么特别的，就是想有个地方和路过的人聊几句。
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-shrink-0 items-center gap-3 font-medium">
          <span>进入聊天室</span>
          <span
            class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white/15 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5">
              <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
              <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
